{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1518877-what-are-your-vampire-house-rules","id":1518877,"title":"What Are Your Vampire House Rules?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-26T23:56:33-07:00","id":1518877,"title":"What Are Your Vampire House Rules?","content":"I was wondering what people's house rules were, so I figured I'd start a thread to ask. It's been a long time since the last House Rule thread, various supplement books have been released since, and was wondering what people have developed in the meantime!<br /> <br /> The only one I have so far is that vampires start with six Discipline dots rather than three. Also the use of None More Dark's and Falco's books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Proud creator of <b><a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/420206/Curiouser-and-Curiouser-Bargains\" target=\"_blank\">Curiouser and Curiouser Bargains</a></b>, a collection of 30+ Homebrew Contracts and 10+ Entitlements on the STV!<br /> My <b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1GFE19F9st7dhGh9zv_hEQyOSm80Xp7dQwmvFg2SAXJY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules</a></b> for Changeling!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17SsOsKpfdANVZscFHSO_afTx-gD3h0iX3p5q07V4u50/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Vampire!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kR6ASTLjaEDwl3zgANnkRrbk0-s2bvw40uXwS-q15O0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Geist!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27667-super-vlad","name":"Super Vlad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27667_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-27T02:45:40-07:00","id":1518897,"title":"","content":"I houserule that all Bane damage are aggravated. To me 5/7 bashing damage for entering an house without invitation is a joke, a vampire can easily heal from the first blood points drinked once inside<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-27T03:03:00-07:00","id":1518901,"title":"","content":"Not much, other than vaguely entertained ideas of tying dice-based Feeding scenes into the Chases system, and streamlining Strix mechanics in line with Hunter 2e's Horros &amp; Dread Powers schema.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-27T11:54:52-07:00","id":1518948,"title":"","content":"Are we talking just 2e or can I share some of my old 1e house rules?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-27T20:12:57-07:00","id":1518984,"title":"","content":"Preferably 2e, but feel free to share them anyways!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Proud creator of <b><a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/420206/Curiouser-and-Curiouser-Bargains\" target=\"_blank\">Curiouser and Curiouser Bargains</a></b>, a collection of 30+ Homebrew Contracts and 10+ Entitlements on the STV!<br /> My <b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1GFE19F9st7dhGh9zv_hEQyOSm80Xp7dQwmvFg2SAXJY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules</a></b> for Changeling!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17SsOsKpfdANVZscFHSO_afTx-gD3h0iX3p5q07V4u50/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Vampire!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kR6ASTLjaEDwl3zgANnkRrbk0-s2bvw40uXwS-q15O0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Geist!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27667-super-vlad","name":"Super Vlad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27667_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-28T14:11:48-07:00","id":1519047,"title":"","content":"Do not add Athletic to Defense<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25958-veiros","name":"veiros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25958_1.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-31T08:00:33-07:00","id":1519249,"title":"","content":"Numerous additions over the years. Here are some:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>The Embrace: </b>System-wise, the Embrace costs one permanent Willpower dot and one dot of Blood Potency. If a Kindred with BP 1 attempts to Embrace, the Childe will be a Revenant unless the Sire sacrifices <u>3</u> Willpower dots. Similarly, if the Sire wishes to Embrace without losing Blood Potency, he may sacrifice 3 Willpower dots.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Celerity</b>: At Celerity \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf, the gains the option of an extra action as an active effect; thus, burning two Vitae allows the vampire to both move to the head of initiative, take his normal action, and then take an additional action. This effect may only be chosen once, no matter how much Vitae the vampire spends. At Celerity \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf, The vampire may use this effect up to twice in a turn.<br /> <br /> <b>Auspex</b>: For <i>Telepathy</i>, replace Socialize with Empathy.<br /> \u200b</span><br /> <br /> <b>Vitae:</b> Max Vitae increases at a different rate.<br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u200b</span><br /> \u200b <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_Table\" align=\"left\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"text_table_Table_td\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Blood Potency</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Trait Maximum</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Max Vitae/Max per Turn</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Can feed from. . .</span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">1</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">5</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">10/1</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">Animals</span></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">5</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">12/2</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Animals</span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">3</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">5</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">15/3</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">Humans</span></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">4</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">5</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">19/4</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Humans</span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">5</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">5</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">24/5</span></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9d9d9\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">Humans</span></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">30/6</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_Table_td\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vampires</span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_Table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_Table_td\" style=\"background-color: #d9